 ## Acceptance
 
 1. A reader pinned to the same planning commit, as-of time and usage receipt produces identical normalized rows across rebuilds. The existing ten-row seed matches the recorded board values and carries partial coverage and no Cost.
-2. Replay duplicate and conflicting records, a late correction, a draft alias and an interrupted multi-story publication. Each observation counts at most once and prior pinned views remain unchanged.
-3. Verify the parallel fixture, same-actor tool overlap, explicit owner waits, scoped elapsed endpoints, and a missing endpoint. An estimate with mismatched phase, role, or partial coverage cannot calibrate.
