+3. Verify the parallel fixture, same-actor tool overlap, two overlapping owner waits while another actor works, pending versus missing wait endpoints, scoped elapsed endpoints, and a missing elapsed endpoint. An estimate with mismatched phase, role, or partial coverage cannot calibrate.
 4. Run a controlled dogfood capture with a provider qualified for the chosen boundaries. Verify safe receipts and a refreshed dashboard row while timing or cost from another source is absent. Verify a fresh reader can reconstruct it without a running Core service.
 5. With a fixed monitor usage fixture, compare priced totals, pricing basis and unknown coverage with the source report. Additional tool time with unchanged tokens changes Actual only. No unauthenticated provider data enters story totals.
